    "r3c2": {
      "en": "A Rebellious person does not believe in social norms. They take delight in caprice rather than virtue\\u002c in evil rather than goodness\\u002c and in cruelty rather than kindness.",
      "cn": "叛逆处世者，直性狭中、黑白颠倒。“应笑”而不笑、“应喜”而不喜、“应慈”而不慈、“闻恶”而不改、“闻善”而不乐。",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
